                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Fact of having added the extrajudicial inventory of
                        part of the effects of the late Young.</hi></head>
                <p>I certify that at this point is added the extrajudicial inventory made on the
                    part of the effects of the late Owen Young, it having been presented by Mr.
                    George Young, who is said to be recognized as the natural son of the deceased,
                    and the judge of the primary court of claims, Dr. Don José Ascencio Urtéaga,
                    having ordered it, follows the judicial proceedings of the intestate; and that
                    the aforesaid document added to it as follows:</p>


